From: Masayuki Nakano <masayuki@d-toybox.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 23:20:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Bug 2082322 - Correct the loop in `GdkEventQueue::IndexOf`
 r=m_kato

It's almost always returning `0` due to the silly mistake.

Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D341685

Origin: https://github.com/mozilla-firefox/firefox/commit/f4ae3f55725f7f26926bc4b5731e1aae18757041
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-23
---
 widget/gtk/IMContextWrapper.h | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/widget/gtk/IMContextWrapper.h b/widget/gtk/IMContextWrapper.h
index e46f8eb6a1544..bf14af6dd0421 100644
--- a/widget/gtk/IMContextWrapper.h
+++ b/widget/gtk/IMContextWrapper.h
@@ -524,8 +524,8 @@ class IMContextWrapper final : public TextEventDispatcherListener {
               NS_WARN_IF(event->state != (aEvent->state & GDK_MODIFIER_MASK))) {
             continue;
           }
+          return i;
         }
-        return i;
       }
       return GdkEventKeyQueue::NoIndex();
     }
